  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After young Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable calls Sha Xiao grandpa inside the dream realm, a violent transfer dumps fighting techniques, Gu recipes, and this killer move into his mind. The cast has eight steps; if the struck person washes their eyes with water, the residue produces high heat that can burn them blind. He rejects the move as insidious and against his upright self-image, and trains fighting techniques instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1496
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "char_sha_xiao",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the clan competition stage, when Fang Yuan gains control of the body, he casts blurred grey eyes at once, blinds the opponent, and kicks him off the stage for victory.",
      "chapters": [
        1496
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sha Xiao notes that young Thieving Heaven had not trained blurred grey eyes, yet used it smoothly under Fang Yuan’s control. In a later bout against a girl, the white ash passes through her defensive methods and covers her eyes.",
